  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div id=\"contentwrapper\"> <p>August 7th, 2026 | <a href=\"https://www.toxel.com/category/tech/\" rel=\"category tag\">Tech</a> | </p>\n\t<div><p><img loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Flat Chair by Sara Paculdo\" src=\"https://www.toxel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/saraflatchair01.jpg\" alt=\"Flat Chair by Sara Paculdo\" width=\"450\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p>Innovative <a href=\"https://www.toxel.com/inspiration/2026/07/01/sea-level-rise-chair/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">chair</a> with flat-pack design created around the principles of efficient manufacturing, compact transportation, and structural simplicity.</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>Made from durable fiberglass panels, the <a href=\"https://www.toxel.com/inspiration/2026/05/01/toilet-paper-chair/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">chair</a> is delivered as flat-packed product and assembled by the user in a matter of minutes.</p>\n<p>Flat Chair designed by <a href=\"https://paculdo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sara Paculdo</a> greatly reduces <a href=\"https://www.toxel.com/tech/2018/07/08/shipping-container-pool/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">shipping</a> volume, storage requirements, and transportation costs.</p></blockquote>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Flat Chair Project\" src=\"https://www.toxel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/saraflatchair02.jpg\" alt=\"Flat Chair Project\" width=\"450\" height=\"435\"></p>\n<p>Flat Chair relies on curves, folds, and interlocking components that form strength through tension rather than excessive material use.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Flat Chair\" src=\"https://www.toxel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/saraflatchair04.jpg\" alt=\"Flat Chair\" width=\"450\" height=\"231\"></p>\n<p>By arriving flat and assembling later, design addresses logistical inefficiencies.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Sara Paculdo Chair\" src=\"https://www.toxel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/saraflatchair05.jpg\" alt=\"Sara Paculdo Chair\" width=\"450\" height=\"327\"></p>\n<p>The Flat Chair Project is a wonderful example of doing more with less.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Sara Paculdo Flat Chair\" src=\"https://www.toxel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/saraflatchair03.jpg\" alt=\"Sara Paculdo Flat Chair\" width=\"450\" height=\"327\"></p>\n<p>Also check out: <a href=\"https://www.toxel.com/inspiration/2018/04/06/yin-yang-chairs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yin Yang Chairs</a></p>\n</div> <p><a href=\"http://cleverbusinesscards.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://toxel.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/ccardss.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"458\" height=\"210\"></a></p>\n\n<!-- Start Comments --> <!-- nothing --> <!-- nothing --> <!-- insert comments --> </div></div>",
